menuconfig DRIVERS_MAGNETOMETER_QMC5883L_SOFTI2C
	bool "qmc5883l_softi2c"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for a QMC5883L magnetometer connected over a
		software (bit-banged) I2C bus built from two plain GPIOs.

		Needed on boards that do not route a usable hardware I2C bus to a
		connector (e.g. rm2027/fmu-h743). The board must define
		BOARD_QMC5883L_SOFTI2C_SCL_PINSET and BOARD_QMC5883L_SOFTI2C_SDA_PINSET
		in its board_config.h.
